{"version":1,"key":"card:88","content":{"id":88,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"背景","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1b2dd7b3-29da-4227-b1d2-6099b44d3d5b","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"今天我突然想开一个新的账户，专门用来写一些电子书，在通过电子邮箱创建了另一个账户之后，第一件事就是为这个账户添加一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"ssh","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的公钥，这样就不用每次提交都要输入密码了，但是当我试图直接将我电脑上的公钥提交时，它提示我这个公钥已经存在，这是我另一个 Github 账户使用的公钥，这使我意识到不同的账户不能使用相同的公钥。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1ced0c7b-a2c1-45d4-a74b-0f92a5df6fb5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"解决办法","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4633afa0-7fda-4e3f-8f78-b149d3c5d157","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"首先需要为新账号生成新的公钥和私钥","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ac43ea09-5c12-4ed5-9164-51ad511df5ce","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"ssh-keygen -t rsa -f ~/.ssh/id_rsa_bookonly -C \"youremail\"","collabId":"0162bf8d-4635-472d-9170-1b8a0cc376d1","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"8ea8e2c3-54ed-46a8-bc54-a8ddb66176f1","language":"bash","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"42bcdb51-1817-4940-91cd-7564a2fa337e"},{"children":[{"text":"然后就可以在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":".ssh","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 文件夹中看到生成的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"id_rsa_bookonly","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"id_rsa_bookonly.pub","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 文件，现在我们将 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"t